# TODO: Real Twitch OAuth token exchange must be implemented on backend/serverless function.
# Do not expose TWITCH_CLIENT_SECRET or GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET to the frontend bundle.
# Prefer VITE_TWITCH_PROVIDER_URL / VITE_YOUTUBE_PROVIDER_URL for production.
# VITE_TWITCH_ACCESS_TOKEN and VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY are only for restricted local/dev experiments.
# VITE_ANALYTICS_ENDPOINT can receive JSON product events from the browser.
# VITE_GGBOX_ADMIN_KEY only gates the demo admin UI; production admin auth must be server-side.
